{"seq":1,"slug":"strategy","title":"招聘策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hiring-philosophy","title":"招聘哲学与组织对齐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/strategy/hiring-philosophy","wordCount":1844,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"role-definition-leveling","title":"角色定义与层级体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/strategy/role-definition-leveling","wordCount":1749,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"sourcing-pipeline","title":"人才供给管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/strategy/sourcing-pipeline","wordCount":1792,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"招聘策略\">招聘策略</h1><p>招聘策略回答三个根本问题：为什么要招人、招什么样的人、从哪里找到他们。在资源有限的前提下，策略层的决策质量直接决定后续所有环节的效率上限。</p>\n<p>本章从招聘哲学的确立出发，建立组织对「好工程师」的共识定义；继而通过角色定义与层级体系将模糊的用人需求转化为精确的岗位画像；最终构建一个多渠道的人才供给管道，确保候选人池的持续充沛与质量可控。</p>\n<p>三篇内容的递进关系：哲学定调 → 画像落地 → 管道搭建。</p>\n"}